WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.639
- Guys, we did it.

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:04.080
- I don't think I can
go to another wedding.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.378
- Hey guys, come on, we
have two more, alright?

00:00:06.378 --> 00:00:10.888
- And then, wedding season is over. Over.

00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:12.069
(phone rings)

00:00:12.069 --> 00:00:13.347
Got a phone call.

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:15.544
Hey, cousin Roberto, what's up?

00:00:15.544 --> 00:00:18.089
- (sigh) What a season.

00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:20.655
- Oh, hey, look at that. Go USA!

00:00:20.655 --> 00:00:22.837
- [Phone] Quinta, guess
what. I'm getting married!

00:00:22.837 --> 00:00:24.509
- You're getting married? That's awesome!

00:00:24.509 --> 00:00:26.355
Congratulations! I'm so happy for you.

00:00:26.355 --> 00:00:28.375
- [Phone] Yes yes. You must
come to my wedding, love.

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:29.914
You have to be there.

00:00:29.914 --> 00:00:33.411
- Uh, yeah, um, of course
I'll come to your wedding.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.867
- Justin, how many gay friends do we have?

00:00:40.049 --> 00:00:42.237
(muttered counting)

00:00:42.237 --> 00:00:43.156
- [Phone] There will be a big wedding,

00:00:43.156 --> 00:00:44.977
the reception, the second reception

00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:46.534
- How many celebrations are you having?

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:48.438
- That's double the weddings!

00:00:48.438 --> 00:00:50.260
- So, wait, in how many different cities?

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.838
- [Phone] Only three. Four
including Ohio, for his family.

00:00:52.838 --> 00:00:56.494
Wait, five including mine.
It's gonna be so great.

00:00:56.494 --> 00:01:01.389
(dramatic music)

00:01:01.389 --> 00:01:03.105
- It's not over.

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:04.818
- I'm gonna stick out
like a straight white male

00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:06.154
at a gay man's wedding!

00:01:06.154 --> 00:01:09.357
- We have to go to 47 weddings
in the next two months!

00:01:09.357 --> 00:01:11.355
Oh no. It's 48.

00:01:11.355 --> 00:01:12.991
- (shouting) Oh God!

00:01:12.991 --> 00:01:15.087
- Not only are you guys
invited to the wedding.

00:01:15.087 --> 00:01:17.085
Quinta, I want you to be my bridesmaid.

00:01:17.085 --> 00:01:19.280
And Justin, I want you to be my bridesman.

00:01:19.936 --> 00:01:21.997
- I have to be a bridesmaid
in double the weddings.

00:01:21.997 --> 00:01:23.375
Double the weddings!

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:27.005
- (muttering) Double the
weddings. Double the weddings.

00:01:27.005 --> 00:01:29.138
- I cannot take a gay
man's bachelor party.

00:01:29.138 --> 00:01:31.826
- The macarenas challenge
me with these people!

00:01:31.826 --> 00:01:33.158
- It's all about the YMCA now.

00:01:33.158 --> 00:01:35.236
(shouting)

00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:38.114
- I'm gonna go broke. Broke!

00:01:38.114 --> 00:01:39.937
- Alright, so I took care of the present.

00:01:39.937 --> 00:01:41.503
- Give me that.

00:01:41.503 --> 00:01:42.237
- No!

00:01:42.237 --> 00:01:45.058
- This is Sunbeam, Zach.
You went to Target?

00:01:45.058 --> 00:01:46.754
- Williams-Sonoma is too expensive!

00:01:46.754 --> 00:01:50.978
(shouting)

00:01:50.978 --> 00:01:53.800
Why is this happening?

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:58.800
(eerie music)

00:02:01.226 --> 00:02:03.612
- [Group] We're friends.

00:02:03.612 --> 00:02:06.056
Til death do us part.

00:02:07.606 --> 00:02:12.606
(upbeat trumpet music)

00:02:17.221 --> 00:02:18.452
(screams)

00:02:18.452 --> 00:02:20.831
- Oh my God, it's just our
neighbor Christian. What's up?

00:02:20.831 --> 00:02:23.618
- Oh nothing. Where you
guys headed, so fancy?

00:02:23.618 --> 00:02:25.336
- Just going to a wedding.

00:02:25.336 --> 00:02:28.330
- It's our friends Nathaniel and Steve.

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.710
- I'm sorry. Did you say Nathan and,

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.359
it sounded like you said Steve.

00:02:32.359 --> 00:02:36.303
I mean that, I know, would be a,

00:02:36.303 --> 00:02:37.667
unnatural.

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:39.509
- Run. He's a conservative, run!

00:02:39.509 --> 00:02:43.592
(upbeat trumpet music)

